text.section:
In adopting such regulations, the Board shall establish criteria for the following:

Specific species of goats, sheep, and hogs that may be held;


Minimum contiguous acreage necessary;


Humane care and humane killing of animals being held;


Methods and procedures for disposal of animals;


Reporting the death of every animal being held in the shooting enclosure not killed by the clientele; and


Ensuring the reasonable utilization of all animals killed by the clientele.
